  "description": "Designed for You in A Variety of Color Styles\nVitilan has customized 4 different colors for you. Pick your mood!\nBrushless Hub Motor\nNot all motors are created equal. Vitikan L5 has a 500W sustained, 960W peak motor that can output 65Nm of torque. This means you can easily pass up and down the slopes.\nYour companion will explore the city and embody style.\nThe combination of comfort, reliability, and smart technology means you can spend more time enjoying your journey, wherever you want to go. you are making the right choice for your transportation.\n720Wh Removable battery\nEquipped with the 48V 15Ah Samsung battery for more power and a longer range of up to 80 kilometers, the removable battery design offers additional riding options.\nA smooth, peppy ride\nEnjoy a smooth ride and precise control. Smart torque sensor translate every movement into smooth motor power.\n0 time lag, instantaneous\nIntelligent Colour Display\nL5 with a TFT color smart meter. The display is fully laminated with tempered glass so you can see the screen in sunlight. It includes an automatic light sensor and Apple AirTag location function. You don't need to worry about your e-bike being stolen and untraceable anymore. In addition, the display also has an APP smart control system that connects the bike to the Vitilan smart app for easy control of the bike. The app also offers more personalized bike settings.\nAdjustable Spring Suspension Fork\nAdjustable Suspension Fork can help you absorb the impact of the ground and obstacles, reducing your bumps on the road.\nHydraulic Brake\nSensitive 180mm mechanical disc brakes provide ample braking force even in the harshest conditions efficiently.\nShimano 7-speed Gear Shift System\nYou can choose different gears according to the road conditions, giving you a more comfortable riding experience.\nIntegrated taillights\nThe Superman-like rear turn signal can be a good safety warning when you are riding in traffic or the crowd.\nAnti-Puncture Tires\nVersatile tires with anti-puncture technology for city, gravel and long-distance driving.",
